 "system": "adaptintake_v2",
 "transcript": [
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hello, I'm here to help you get ready for your appointment. Could you tell me what has been bothering you?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Pain in my left flank."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Can you tell me when this started and whether it came on suddenly or gradually, and also whether you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It’s been there four or five days."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How much is the pain affecting your daily activities, and what medicines do you take regularly or have taken recently, including any new or changed ones?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "My daughter keeps telling me I should rest more."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any allergies or bad reactions to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No, I haven’t noticed any allergies to medicines."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Do you have any ongoing health conditions that you see a doctor about regularly?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "A doctor told me I have a stone in the left ureter."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How bad is the pain in your left flank right now: mild, moderate, or severe, or are you not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I’m not sure how bad it is."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Have you noticed anything else going on with your body along with the pain in your left side?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I keep feeling sick and vomiting."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What medicines are you taking at the moment — only your regular ones, any new or changed ones as well, or none?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I don’t take any regular medicines."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Does anything make the pain in your left side better or worse?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I haven’t noticed anything that makes it better or worse."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is the pain in your left side there all the time, or does it come and go?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I haven’t noticed it coming and going."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Aside from the stone your doctor mentioned, is there anything else in your past health I should know about — for example, conditions you see a doctor or nurse about regularly, operations or hospital stays, or conditions you used to take medicines for, even though you don’t take regular medicines now — or is there nothing else?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "Nothing else that I know of."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What worries you most about this, and what are you hoping to get from today’s visit?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I want something done about the stone."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the feeling sick and vomiting you mentioned, has anything else changed in how you feel or how your body is working since this started, or has nothing else changed?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No blood in my urine."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "What does the pain in your left side feel like?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "It’s in my abdomen and across my back."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How has all this been affecting your sleep?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I haven’t noticed any change in my sleep."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Besides the feeling sick and vomiting, is there anything else you’ve noticed since this started that you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No fevers."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "How would you describe the feeling of the pain in your abdomen and back — would you say it's sharp, dull, burning, or you're not sure?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "I’m not sure how to describe it."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Is there anything else you’ve noticed about how you’re feeling that you’d like to add?"
  },
  {
   "role": "patient",
   "text": "No pain or burning when passing urine."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Thank you, that is very helpful. I have put together a short summary of what you told me. Please read it and tell me if anything should be corrected before it goes to your doctor."
  }
 ],
